    "Scan of the 1982 edition of the Ninepin Branch, Maryland, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1978; field checked in 1975; last revised in 1982; printed in 1983.",
    "Variations: woodland tint, orthophotomap. Sheet size: 21.8 x 26.9 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
